.TH KUMLOCK 1 "2026" "kumde 0.8.0" "KumDE Manual"
.SH NAME
kumlock \- screen locker for KumDE
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kumlock
.SH DESCRIPTION
kumlock locks all outputs using the
.B ext-session-lock-v1
protocol. It shows the current time, date, username, and a password
dot indicator (one dot per character typed, capped, so length isn't
directly readable). Password entry is verified against PAM using the
.I login
service.
.PP
Typically spawned by
.BR kumidle (1)
at its lock threshold, bound to a key (Super+Shift+l by default), or
run manually before suspending.
.SH KEY BINDINGS
.TP
.B Enter
Attempt to unlock.
.TP
.B Backspace
Delete the last character.
.TP
.B Escape
Clear the current input.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kumde (1),
.BR kumidle (1)
